1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,500
Every cup begins as a cherry.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:06,500
Picked by hand, high on a farm.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,500
Dried, hulled, packed in sacks.

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,500
Shipped across the sea, in weeks.

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,500
Roasted until it turns dark.

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:19,000
Then brewed, and poured for you.
